Name: Lua
Short Name: lua
URL: https://www.lua.org/
Version: 5.4.7
License: MIT
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Embedded Lua 5.4 interpreter used by LemurX to expose native browser APIs to
Lua scripts. Standalone interpreter sources (lua.c / luac.c) are not compiled.

The following standard libraries are compiled but not opened at runtime:
io, os, debug, package. Scripts only get base/table/string/math/utf8/coroutine.

Local Modifications:
- None. Interpreter binaries (lua.c, luac.c) are omitted from the build.
